#: ../../chapter4.rst:3
msgid "Folder and File Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:5
msgid ""
"When you right-click on a folder or a file you will see the context menu."
" Use this menu to perform various actions on the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:8
msgid "Cloud Drive Context Menus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:10
msgid ""
"The context menu will vary depending on what you right-click on. For "
"instance, in the image below you see three variants of the context menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:15
msgid "CLOUD DRIVE CONTEXT MENU"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:18
msgid "Context Menu for Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:21 ../../chapter4.rst:42
msgid "**Share...**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:21
msgid ""
"This is to share out the file with anyone by email. Multiple emails can "
"be added at the same time by seperating them with a \";\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:24
msgid "**Get Share Link (Read Only): <filename>**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:24
msgid ""
"This is to get a read-only web link to the file. This option allows you "
"to share a file as a public (Read Only) link. Anyone with the link can "
"access this file. Click this option to copy the public link to your "
"clipboard. Once you click \"Ok\", you can paste that link anywhere (e.g.,"
" email, social media)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:27
msgid "**Manage Revisions**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:27
msgid ""
"This option will open a web browser where you get access to the Web "
"Portal version manager for the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:30
msgid "**Check Out (Lock) <filename>**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:30
msgid ""
"This option is to manually check out file. All changes to the file will "
"remain local until it is Checked In."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:33 ../../chapter4.rst:54
msgid "**Force refresh**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:33 ../../chapter4.rst:54
msgid "Click this to synchronize the web portal with your local folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:36
msgid "Context Menu for Folders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:39
msgid "**Request a file**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:39
msgid ""
"This is to share out a folder link to a user and request the user to "
"upload a file. You can request a file from multiple emails at once by "
"using a \";\" to seperate them. This upload link can be set to expire in "
"a certain amount of time or never."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:42
msgid ""
"This is to share out the folder with anyone by email. Multiple emails can"
" be added at the same time by seperating them with a \";\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:45
msgid "**Get Share Link (Read Only): <foldername>**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:45
msgid ""
"This is to get a read-only web link to the folder. This option allows you"
" to share a folder as a public (Read Only) link. Anyone with the link can"
" access this folder. Click this option to copy the public link to your "
"clipboard. Once you click Ok, you can paste that link anywhere (e.g., "
"email, social media)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:48
msgid "**Enable/Disable Offline Access**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:48
msgid ""
"This is to enable offline access to the folder so the folder content can "
"be pre-fetched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:51
msgid "**Open in Web Browser**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter4.rst:51
msgid "Opens a web browser and take you to that file in the Web Portal."
msgstr ""

